A URL shortener API using FastAPI.

RUN:

1. Clone repository:
    git clone https://github.com/pyrithia/url-shortener
2. Navigate to project:
    cd url-shortener
3. Install dependencies:
    uv sync
4. Set database URL:
    echo "DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///urls.db" > .env
5. Apply migrations:
    uv run alembic upgrade head
6. Start server:
    uv run fastapi dev

ENDPOINTS:

POST /urls Create a new shortened URL.

GET /urls Retrieve all URLs.

GET /urls/{id} Retrieve a URL by ID.

DELETE /urls/{id} Delete a URL by ID.

GET /{code} Redirect to the original URL.
